  ✓ Stage 2: establish contract, regenerate MPython, and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Stage 3: reconstruct all definitions and positive proofs from clean scratch
  ✓ Stage 4: audit claim adequacy, satisfiability, concrete witnesses, and real-program pinning
  ✓ Stage 5: inventory and assess every syntax/function/rule/claim statically
  → Stage 6: build and run a fresh meaningful false mutation
  • Stage 7: account for proven versus assumed facts and write REVIEW.md plus evidence
